      </div>

      <div class="pricing-faq-grid">
        <div class="pricing-faq-item">
          <h4 class="pricing-faq-question">{{ 'Can I switch plans at any time?'|t }}</h4>
          <p class="pricing-faq-answer">{{ 'Yes, you can upgrade or downgrade your plan at any time. Changes take effect immediately, and billing is adjusted accordingly.'|t }}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pricing-faq-item">
          <h4 class="pricing-faq-question">{{ 'Is there a free trial for paid plans?'|t }}</h4>
