        </div>
        <div class="pricing-faq-item">
          <h4 class="pricing-faq-question">{{ 'What payment methods do you accept?'|t }}</h4>
          <p class="pricing-faq-answer">{{ 'We accept all major credit cards, bank transfers, and digital wallets including Apple Pay and Mada.'|t }}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pricing-faq-item">
          <h4 class="pricing-faq-question">{{ 'Can I cancel my subscription?'|t }}</h4>
          <p class="pricing-faq-answer">{{ 'You can cancel your subscription at any time. Your access will continue until the end of the current billing period.'|t }}</p>
        </div>
